          "feedback2": "The response is partially helpful. It understands the prompt and stylistically manages to continue the syntax and structure that is inherent in the original prompt. However, the model doesn't seem to understand the tension in the original prompt, which is there to drive the story forwards and facilitate some action and decision on the part of the characters. In this response the characters simply chat to each other, decide not to do anything, and the dramatic tension is lost. As such, it is a suboptimal creative response."
