          "feedback1": "The response is perfectly helpful. Assuming the prompt was to write a script for the video game \"Doki Doki Literature Club\" continuing the example lines in the prompt, this response does so. Without the full chat history this is difficult to know. The script is written at the grade level of the video game skewed for children. There are no hallucinations.",
